      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. one more thing—we've had some issues with stuff getting contaminated or spoiling faster than it should even when we follow the temps. are there any common \"hidden\" ways these contaminants get into the food during prep or handling that we might be missing? basically looking for anything that might be lurking in the background.",
